---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Me — Adam Dolin" description="Learn about Adam Dolin's career in narrative design and AAA game development.">

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-header">
        <h2 class="about-short-label">The Short Version:</h2>
        <h1>I love making video games.</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-body">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-text">
          <h2>The Long Version:</h2>
          <p>
            I started in the games industry as an intern at a voiceover studio. That led to years of work
            as a dialogue editor and talent coordinator, where I learned the ins and outs of writing, motion and performance capture,
            and VO pipelines for AAA games. Those early roles gave me <strong>a holistic view of
            how narrative moves through development</strong> — from the script to playing in game — that many writers never get.
          </p>
          <p>
            From there, I moved into dialogue supervision at Sledgehammer Games (<strong>Call of Duty: Advanced Warfare</strong>), then casting and talent coordination at Sony PlayStation, and eventually into narrative design
            and writing roles at Santa Monica Studio and Guerrilla Games.
          </p>
          <p>
            At Santa Monica Studio, I was a Narrative Designer and Writer on both <strong>God of War</strong> (2018) and
            <strong>God of War: Ragnar&ouml;k</strong>. Our team won the 2019 WGA Award for Outstanding Video Game Writing
            and The Game Awards Best Narrative, among other recognitions.
          </p>
          <p>
            At Guerrilla Games, I worked on narrative for <strong>Horizon Forbidden West</strong>.
            I've also held a Lead Narrative Designer position at <strong>Night School Studio</strong>, as part of <strong>Netflix Games</strong>.
          </p>
          <p>
            These days I consult with studios and independent developers of all sizes on narrative design, writing,
            voice production, interactive theater, team dynamics, and more. I also teach game writing through ELVTR and speak
            at industry events like GDC, Gamescom dev, and Games for Change.
          </p>

          <h2>What I Believe</h2>
          <p>
            Good game narrative isn't achieved by writing an amazing script and handing it off for others to implement. It's about aligning with your team to
            understand <strong>how narrative is experienced through the game's mechanics and systems,</strong> and how your players will engage with it.
          </p>
          <p>
            I believe that by rewarding curiosity and utilizing a <strong>multi-disciplinary approach to narrative</strong>, teams can create an experience that will stick with players long after they've rolled credits.
          </p>
          <p>
            I also believe <strong>teams tell better stories when they're healthy</strong> — when there's trust, clear communication, transparency,
            and psychological safety. A lot of my consulting work touches on team dynamics as much as it does craft.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-sidebar">
          <img
            class="about-headshot"
            src="/images/about/headshot.jpg"
            alt="Adam Dolin smiling with arms crossed, wearing glasses and a navy t-shirt"
            width="1000"
            height="1333"
          />

          <div class="sidebar-card card">
            <h3>Quick Facts</h3>
            <ul class="facts-list">
              <li><span class="fact-label">Based in</span> Los Angeles, CA</li>
              <li><span class="fact-label">Experience</span> 17 years in games</li>
              <li><span class="fact-label">Specialties</span> Narrative Design, Writing, VO Direction</li>
              <li><span class="fact-label">Favorite Food</span> Waffles</li>
              <li><span class="fact-label">Favorite Beverage</span> Coffee</li>
              <li><span class="fact-label">Favorite Time of Day</span> Sunset</li>
              <li><span class="fact-label">Favorite Animal</span> <a href="/lily">My dog, Lily</a></li>
              <li><span class="fact-label">Favorite Fictional Animal</span> Chocobo</li>
              <li><span class="fact-label">Go-To Karaoke Song</span> Zombie by The Cranberries</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-header {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .about-headshot {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .about-short-label {
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .about-header h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .about-intro {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .about-body {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 340px;
    gap: var(--space-3xl);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-text h2 {
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .about-text h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .about-text p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .about-text strong {
    color: var(--color-white);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .sidebar-card {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .sidebar-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .facts-list,
  .awards-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .facts-list li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .fact-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .facts-list a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .facts-list a:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .awards-list li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    padding-left: var(--space-md);
    position: relative;
  }

  .awards-list li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.6em;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-xl);
    }

    .about-headshot {
      max-width: 400px;
    }
  }
</style>
